            },
            {
              "title": "Step 3 \u2014 Reserve",
              "description": "Place a fully refundable $99 hold to take the car off the market while you finalize your decision.",
              "metadata": {
                "step": "3"
              }
            },
            {
              "title": "Step 4 \u2014 Close",
